---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<Layout title="Resume — Udhaya Kumar" description="Download the resume for Udhaya Kumar, Senior Backend Engineer with Data Platform Focus.">
  <section class="section-block">
    <h1 class="font-code text-40 font-semibold mb-8">Resume</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 65ch;">Architect and operate high-scale data systems where every layer (ingestion, modeling, serving, operations) matters. Rearchitected the data platform from legacy batch-sync (days-late latency) to real-time CDC with sub-5-minute latency for webhook platforms, ~1–6 hours for others, serving 200+ merchants. Designed segmentation engine (1,000+ active segments, 80% merchant adoption) and built recommendation system from zero-to-one. Grew backend platform team from 4 to 7 engineers.</p>
    <p class="text-14 text-ink-2 max-w-[65ch]">Seeking: Staff Engineer, Principal Engineer, or Founding Engineer roles in data infrastructure or platform systems. Remote-first.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section-block">
    <p style="max-width: 65ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 32px;">I've created a consolidated resume that highlights my end-to-end infrastructure ownership. Download and tell me what system you need owned.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Download Resume -->
  <section class="section-block">
    <a href="/Udhayakumar-Resume.pdf" class="no-underline block p-8 bg-panel border-2 border-accent rounded transition-[border-color] duration-200">
      <p class="label-mono">Download Resume · PDF</p>
      <p style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 8px;">Senior Backend Engineer, Data Platform Focus</p>
      <p class="text-16 text-ink-2 mb-3">Aug 2020–May 2026 · 13+ years total experience</p>
      <p class="text-16 text-ink-2">Backend infrastructure, data platforms, distributed systems, migrations, observability, and production ownership.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- Questions section -->
  <section style="margin: 52px 0; padding: 32px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">
    <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px;">Questions about the resume?</h3>
    <p style="max-width: 65ch; color: var(--ink-2);">Email me with the system you need owned, and I can discuss specific details. The resume links back to case studies and incident records for verification.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 28px 0 0;">
    <a href="/case-studies/hard-problems" style="color: var(--accent); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px;">Read the ten incident records that shaped this resume →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
